## 🖧 Network Topology

The network consists of:

- **1 Router:** R1
- **2 Switches:** SW1 and SW2
- **3 PCs:** PC-A, PC-B, and PC-C
- **2 VLANs:** VLAN 10 and VLAN 20

**Logical topology:**

```text
                     R1
                      |
                802.1Q Trunk
                      |
                     SW1
                   /     \
                 PC-A    SW2
                          |
                        /   \
                      PC-B  PC-C
```

The switches use VLANs to separate Layer 2 traffic, while R1 provides Layer 3 routing between the VLANs.

